{"agent":"fx-mcp-ci","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"The new heartbeat wrapper calls `self._progress(call.params)`, but `_progress` takes a progress token and uses it as a dictionary key (`self._says.get(token)` at line ~579). For a normal MCP offloaded call, `call.params` is the decoded JSON request object, i.e. a plain `dict`, and `dict` is unhashable. Given input such as `{\"name\": \"gate_verify\", \"arguments\": {...}, \"_meta\": {\"progressToken\": 1}}`, `self._progress(call.params)` raises `TypeError: unhashable type: 'dict'` before the tool is invoked; the exception is caught and turned into an error, so offloaded tools never run and no progress is sent.","digest":"a424278b06c2002d","location":"ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py:914","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py:914"}],"chunks_total":4,"coverage":"4/4 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":12191,"diff_sha":"05cacee8078b2c9fcf2418413b3865825821709bef225c7338b4e5d1185c6c13","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":620.4,"excluded_bytes":1210924,"excluded_files":3,"excluded_paths":["README.md","tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_outputs.ambr","tests/test_uc_surf_setup_ops_transcript.json"],"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"4facbd79ba0fe497","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B7b3b4cf483.critic.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261022T105052Z-df2041b3.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3,4],"reviewed_head":"98a1df919cb7de08773ffee7ded93d003b7ca3ee","reviewed_paths":{"README.md":"100644 4c9ed543882c68f4105b78ce945516c5d98012dd","ddflow/config_sections/mcp.py":"100644 cef75963ca48d74819eebb7a5814a78ca7f19031","ddflow/surfaces/mcp.py":"100644 1b4cf44f0c29d37bf59ac0877599f8deaabd87ae","ddflow/surfaces/mc